.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Raised from childhood by the assassins of Clan
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Cave Fox, Shou never had to grow up — his skill let
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]him treat killing as a game. He spent years close to
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]his fellow assassin Raine, until Raine broke from
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]the Clan. Now Shou has been sent to track his old
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]friend down, and he's treating the hunt as the best
.L 107.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]game yet.
.L 367.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]Cheerful, playful, and utterly without
.L 377.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]remorse, Shou brings a childlike energy to
.L 387.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]a very adult occupation. He's easily won
.L 397.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]over by food, at least for a little while.
.CP
.SH
\&Shou: Attacks
.PP
\&Bladed Tonfas: The addition of a gleaming edge makes these otherwise humble weapons deadly.
.PP
\&Sweep Kick: Shou unbalances his opponent with a swift, low kick.
.PP
\&Pressure Strike: A precise blow that impedes the opponent's ability to fight.
.PP
\&Dark Spark: By focusing dark magics and striking his blades together, Shou sends out a bolt of energy that devours light in its path.
.SH
\&Shou: Dark World
.PP
\&A dead elder of Clan Cave Fox once trained Shou in shadow magic — letting him become living shadow, cross distances in an instant, and strike with darkness-empowered blows. The bargain that granted these powers left his soul tainted, and he's vulnerable to light.
